  "body_html": "<h1>Dominant Strategy</h1>\n<p>A strategy $s_i\\in S_i$ is dominant for player $i$ if\n$$\n  g_i(s_i,s_{-i})\\ge g_i(t_i,s_{-i})\n  \\quad\\text{for all }t_i\\in S_i,\\ s_{-i}\\in S_{-i}.\n$$\nIt is strictly dominant if the inequality is strict for every\n$t_i\\ne s_i$ and every $s_{-i}$.</p>",
